    <p style="margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65"><strong>Short answer:</strong> These are the official federal court forms, unmodified, exactly as published by the Administrative Office of the U.S. Courts. Every one is a fillable PDF you can complete on a computer. We do not redraw or recreate government forms &mdash; each card also links to the official uscourts.gov page so you can confirm you have the current version.</p>
